                        Move Your Existing Vault in Under Two Minutes
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                        Already using KeePass, KeePassXC, Bitwarden, or 1Password? Import your entire <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-800">.kdbx</code> database directly inside your browser. All your nested folders, logins, SSH keys, and file attachments preserve their exact hierarchy.
                    </p>

                    <ol class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
