                            <span><strong>Select your .kdbx file:</strong> Unlocked locally in browser memory via WebAssembly—your KDBX master password is never sent over the network.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">2</span>
                            <span><strong>Re-encrypt on client:</strong> Every directory and credential is sealed with your PassKee Vault AES-256-GCM key before upload.</span>
