                            <span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">3</span>
                            <span><strong>Export anytime:</strong> No vendor lock-in. Export your PassKee vault back to a standard encrypted <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-800">.kdbx</code> backup whenever you want.</span>
                        </li>
                    </ol>
